From 7fff0171450ec602913ffb56009c5b251a1c4612 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Canonical endpoint audit <audit@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:19:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! net: coalesce outbound inventory with a short
 suppression window

Keep ordinary inbound/outbound inventory means at5s/2s and use independent50ms/25ms clocks only for relayed inventory to high-bandwidth/whitelisted peers. Track local-origin first-hop inventory per peer until ordinary trickle. Preserve known-inventory filtering and test single-tx API without future batch interfaces.
